          "evidence_id": "evidence-0d439ba9d56a",
          "exact": "class-key is one of class, struct and union. The keywords class and struct are identical except for the default member access and the default base class access."
        }
      ],
      "observations": [
        {
          "evidence_id": "evidence-0d439ba9d56a",
          "subject": "class and struct",
          "predicate": "are identical except for",
          "object": "default member access and default base class access; union is listed as a class-key"
        }
      ],
      "applied_rule_refs": [
        "EVD-001",
        "VAL-001",
        "VAL-002"
      ],
      "rationale": "引文分句一 [0,44)（\"class-key is one of class, struct and union.\"）只说明 union 是 class-key 之一；分句二 [45,160)（\"The keywords class and struct are identical except for the default member access and the default base class access.\"）直接支持 claim 前半「class 与 struct 除默认成员访问与默认基类访问外完全相同」。但 claim 后半「union 声明引入联合体类型」在引文中无显式表述：引文未说明以 union 为 class-key 的声明引入联合体类型，该部分依赖引文外知识（class-specifier 定义类、class-key 为 union 时定义联合体），故判 partially_supported。",
